sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant B as Browser
  participant E as Cloudflare Edge
  participant A as React App
  participant H as Health/API
  participant R as Local Runtime or Provider
  participant V as Evidence

  B->>E: GET route
  E-->>B: SSR HTML + render-mode header
  B->>A: Hydrate exact route
  A->>A: Measure paint, hydration, network hints
  alt Healthy
    A->>H: Fetch agent health or task data
    H->>R: Signed request when runtime is online
    R-->>H: Result stream or status
    H-->>A: online response
    A-->>B: Full UI with lazy Evidence assets
  else Weak network or slow device
    A->>A: Enter degraded mode
    A-->>B: Disable non-critical motion and defer heavy media
    A->>V: Record sanitized degradation evidence
  else Runtime/API timeout
    A->>H: Request with timeout and retry budget
    H-->>A: offline / degraded / timeout code
    A-->>B: Local fallback card, no fake success
    A->>V: Record reason code and boundary
  end
